<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Feb jobless rises to 13.69 pct (13.59 Jan).</title>
<headline>Slovak Feb jobless rises to 13.69 pct (13.59 Jan).</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of jobless in Slovakia in February totalled 356,181 persons, or 13.69 percent of the work force, up from 13.59 percent in January, the National</p>
<p>Labour Office said on Thursday.</p>
<p> SLOVAK UNEMPLOYMENT	  FEB 1997   JAN 1997    FEB 1996</p>
<p>  Total jobless		 356,181    353,605     352,109</p>
<p>  Percentage of work force   13.69	13.59	 13.70</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
